{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/759860/extras/7564cbe1df4177ac89d12edd6e672be4.avif?t=1762620831\" width=1364 height=764 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; MGP Manager  - Single player simulation of managing a race team in the motorcycle grand prix world championship. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Start your career with the entry level MGP3 machines or go full on with the MGP1 teams. There are hundreds of riders and staff to potentially sign to try to improve your teams performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Riders can  sustain an injury if they have a crash on track, and could be withdrawn from future events. Terminate rider and staff contracts early if you feel your current riders or staff are not getting the results you would like, and sign a replacement rider or member of staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/759860/extras/1535736423e0e5a5e66c57a082237272.avif?t=1762620831\" width=1366 height=766 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Influence machine development during the current season and also for the following season, choose from specific areas of the machine to improve and choose a long term upgrade goal to help your team perform better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Track Evolution - at the start of an event, the circuit will need time to 'rubber in' to allow riders to set their best times. Rain reduces circuit grip even after the track has dried so this needs to be monitored to ensure your riders are on track at the right time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/759860/extras/5af48b2200be825046f8e8328cf28e8d.avif?t=1762620831\" width=1360 height=766 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Your Choices Make the Difference.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/759860?t=1762620831","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/759860?t=1762620831","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/759860/52152942b2aaa497d8c5c688994559e2db345513/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762620831","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/759860/52152942b2aaa497d8c5c688994559e2db345513/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762620831","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/759860/extras/7564cbe1df4177ac89d12edd6e672be4.avif?t=1762620831\" width=1364 height=764 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; MGP Manager  - Single player simulation of managing a race team in the motorcycle grand prix world championship. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Start your career with the entry level MGP3 machines or go full on with the MGP1 teams. There are hundreds of riders and staff to potentially sign to try to improve your teams performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Riders can  sustain an injury if they have a crash on track, and could be withdrawn from future events. Terminate rider and staff contracts early if you feel your current riders or staff are not getting the results you would like, and sign a replacement rider or member of staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/759860/extras/1535736423e0e5a5e66c57a082237272.avif?t=1762620831\" width=1366 height=766 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Influence machine development during the current season and also for the following season, choose from specific areas of the machine to improve and choose a long term upgrade goal to help your team perform better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Track Evolution - at the start of an event, the circuit will need time to 'rubber in' to allow riders to set their best times. Rain reduces circuit grip even after the track has dried so this needs to be monitored to ensure your riders are on track at the right time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/759860/extras/5af48b2200be825046f8e8328cf28e8d.avif?t=1762620831\" width=1360 height=766 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Your Choices Make the Difference.</p>","developers":["Stephen Tasker"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/759860/3350f38ee3c91876ada57150ebb0c3a0c02131bb/header.jpg?t=1762620831","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) Stephen Tasker 2024","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/759860/1965367263/130f8ce8887ebdb0ae8ee64e92fe6f8c43eddfc6/1762619830/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762620062","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/759860/1965367263/130f8ce8887ebdb0ae8ee64e92fe6f8c43eddfc6/1762619830/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762620062","highlight":true,"hls